  "text": "Election Results | County of Lincoln, NC - Official Website\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account\n- Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nResidents\nVisitors\nBusiness\nSearch\nCampaign Finance\nOpen Candidate Committees\n2026 Election Information\nElection Events\nElection Results\nStaff\nVoting\nAbsentee Voting\nHandicapped and Curbside Voting\nPolling Locations\nVoter Registration\nVoting Election Day\nVote in Honor of a Veteran\nHome\nGovernment\nDepartments\nElections\nElection Results\nElection Results\nLincoln County Election Official Results\nThis page is a listing of candidates and the votes cast from Lincoln County. There are links across the top of the page, under the graphic, for a Summary, Precincts Reporting, Voter Turnout and other Reports.\n05/18/2022 OFFICIAL 2022 Primary Election Results\nPrevious Elections\nYear\nResults\n2020\nLincoln County November, 2020 General Election Official Results\n2020\nLincoln County March 3, 2020 Primary Election Official Results\n2018\nLincoln County November 6, 2018 General Election Official Results\nLincoln County May 8, 2018 Primary Election Official Results\n2016\nLincoln County November, 2016 General Election Official Results\nLincoln County June 7, 2016 Primary Election Official Results\nLincoln County 2016 Primary Election Official Results\n2015\nCity of Lincolnton 2015 General Election Official Results\nCity of Lincolnton 2015 Municipal Primary Election Official Results\n2014\nLincoln County, NC 2014 General Election Official Results\nLincoln County 2014 Primary Election Official Results\n2013\nCity of Lincolnton 2013 Municipal Election Official Results\nArchived Elections\nThe State Board of Elections for North Carolina has past elections beginning with 1992. You can find these on the State Board website under\nElection Results\n. If there is an election that you can not find here, please call the Lincoln County election office at 704-736-8480.\nAgendas\n& Minutes\nOnline\nPayments\nEmployment\nOnline\nServices\nGIS & Maps\nAdoptable Pets\nContact Us\nLincoln County Government\n353 N. Generals Blvd.\nLincolnton, NC 28092\nPO Box 738, Lincolnton, NC 28093-0738\nWebsite Sign In\nQuick Links\nDepartments\nCommunity Resources\nAfter Hours Essential Service Phone Numbers\nAdoptable Pets from Animal Services\nApply for a Passport\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by\nCivicPlus\u00ae\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
